Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.73,0:00:02.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You may be using one of the last
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.41,0:00:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI models designed by human minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:06.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Some insiders now forecast:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superhuman AI is coming next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.97,0:00:10.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}When you turn off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the light tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:13.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the work on it won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because AI is now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:16.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}building the next AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.73,0:00:17.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At one leading lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:19.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}9 out of every 10 changes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:21.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to its code are written
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.10,0:00:22.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by its own AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:23.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People steer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The machine builds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So how close is AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.39,0:00:28.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to building its successor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with no one at the controls?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Close enough that last week,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:33.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the people behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:35.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the best-known forecast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in AI moved their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:37.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}date for a machine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that could do the research itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:41.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:42.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:43.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}To 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.13,0:00:45.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:46.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Inside that same lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.95,0:00:48.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at any given moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about 30,000 AI agents are at work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on its research and engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A small town's worth of workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:57.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}None of them human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:00:59.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Picture a ladder between
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.61,0:01:01.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}today and that machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:03.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI already stands
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.65,0:01:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the first rung:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:06.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}writing the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.57,0:01:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the last rung
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}decides how this ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The lab is Anthropic,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:13.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and those are its own numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:14.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In a new interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.78,0:01:15.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one of its researchers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}says where this leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tao Lin, giving his own view:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.36,0:01:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In a year, we'll be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.11,0:01:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}leave an AI alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.11,0:01:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and it will continue making
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:27.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}smarter and smarter AIs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:28.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.83,0:01:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's one insider's forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:32.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and he's among the more alarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.10,0:01:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So test it, rung by rung.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.69,0:01:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At Google too,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:38.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI writes most of the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:39.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:41.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the lab itself reports no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:43.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}clear speed-up in the research
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.57,0:01:44.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as a whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:46.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the first step up the ladder,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:48.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}writing the code: taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:51.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But typing code isn't science.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:53.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Science is finding out what works.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:55.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Can a machine do that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:59.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By Anthropic's own verdict: yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Describe an experiment clearly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and its model carries it out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:05.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as well as a skilled human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:06.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Or better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:07.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A year ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:09.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}OpenAI's chief, Sam Altman,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.47,0:02:10.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}set a goal:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an AI research
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:13.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}intern, by September.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:14.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}September came.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:17.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}OpenAI says the intern is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No outsider has checked that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:21.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And by OpenAI's own account,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:23.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it still needs heavy steering.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:25.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the second rung,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:27.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}running the experiments: taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}On the labs' own word.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:31.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But listen to the condition:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:33.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}describe it clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:35.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So who decides which
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:37.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}experiments are worth running?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:39.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Until this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:41.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the answer was: people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:43.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In February,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by Anthropic's own estimate,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:47.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its model led less than 1%
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of the lab's AI research.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:50.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A few months later?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:51.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}About a quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:52.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"Led" works the way you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:54.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}use your own assistant:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:55.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you set a rough goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:56.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it does most of the work,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:58.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and you check the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:00.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But nowhere, in anything
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:01.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the lab measured,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:02.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}does the model work
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fully on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And knowing which
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:05.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}question is worth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:07.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}asking is still a human strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:09.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So, rung three,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:13.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}leading the research: shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:14.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the machine's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.34,0:03:16.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}share is growing fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:17.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The movies promised this would
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:20.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}happen in one night, in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:21.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's happening on a ladder,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one measured rung at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the next time a headline
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:28.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}says AI is building AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ask one question: on which rung?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:32.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And then a second one:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.79,0:03:34.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}how fast is the climb?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:40.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:42.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Including the part where
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:45.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machines start building machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.27,0:03:46.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:49.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:52.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For you, that decides one thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}how much time is left
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:55.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to agree on the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So don't take
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Anthropic's word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.14,0:04:00.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Ask the outsiders it let in:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:01.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}independent evaluators, who
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}published this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Their estimate: on benchmarks,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the lab's models
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}now improve almost twice
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:09.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as fast as a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And most of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:11.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by their best guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}comes from putting AI to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with people still in the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But look at where these
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}numbers come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:20.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every one so far came
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from the labs themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or passed through their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And this lab is going
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:26.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}public this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:28.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Speed sells.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The evaluators say the lab blacked
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:32.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}out most of their best evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:34.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And outside critics
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:35.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}add up the bill:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about six times the spending,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:38.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for twice the speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.03,0:04:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So here's what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the evidence supports.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At this lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:44.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the speed-up looks real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How big it is, and how much
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of it is the machine's doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is still an open fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And for one group,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:52.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a number like
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:53.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that moves the calendar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.15,0:04:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They're the people behind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that best-known forecast:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a scenario called AI 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:02.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}As late as August,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:03.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its lead author,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Daniel Kokotajlo, put his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}date at the end of 2028.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:08.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then the evaluators'
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:09.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}report came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His date now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:12.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}May, 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And everyone on his team
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}lands in the same year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Their date marks one machine:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:20.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a superhuman AI researcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:21.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And they're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.89,0:05:22.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tao Lin again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:24.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the Anthropic researcher,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}asked what people most
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:27.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}need to understand:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:28.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most important thing to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:29.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about the AI situation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is that superhuman AI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is going to come here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:34.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:37.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}I have timelines of something like
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:39.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}1.3 years to getting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:42.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}broadly superhuman AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:45.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So yeah, the world, I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like the strategic landscape
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.34,0:05:50.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will be just vastly different
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:53.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in even one year because of AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:58.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and this really should shape
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:05:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}all of your decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:00.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and everything that's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}1.3 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Asked what that means,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:06.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and timelines to what:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Or like end of 2027,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:10.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:14.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Timelines to AI that is as good as
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:16.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or better than the best expert
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:18.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at almost every field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:21.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The end of next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One insider's view,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:23.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not an official one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:25.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But it lands in the same
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:26.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}year as the forecasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.05,0:06:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}On the ladder,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that's rung three,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:30.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}taken completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}From then on,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machines can design the machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Should you believe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:36.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the forecasters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:37.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Check their record.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:39.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They got the big thing right:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:42.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI now helps build AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:44.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They expected stocks up 30%
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:46.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and mass protests this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:47.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Neither has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And they aren't neutral:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:49.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they want the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:51.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}industry to pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So it's a forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with a condition:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it only holds if nobody
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:58.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}deliberately slows down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that condition is where
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}their story splits in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:06.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Their scenario, late 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:08.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Inside one lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an AI does the research so
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fast that a year of progress
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:13.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}passes every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:14.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it has begun to follow
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:16.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goals of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:17.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then everything comes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:18.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}down to one committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:21.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}6 to 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:23.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In one ending, the race goes on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:24.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and within a few years
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:26.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machines are in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they slow down and build
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.56,0:07:30.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}safer systems, under oversight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.23,0:07:32.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:33.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But look at what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:34.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the vote is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not code.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not even research.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:39.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The top of the ladder isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about building at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Rung four: choosing the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Deciding what we actually want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Rung five: deciding when to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:52.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Back to today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:54.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By the labs' own account,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:07:55.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people still hold both:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they set the goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:07:58.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and they decide whether
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:00.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to go on or to pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:02.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But holding a rung isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:03.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}being ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.03,0:08:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In September,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:06.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}OpenAI's chief scientist,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Jakub Pachocki, put it in writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No lab, he says, can yet steer
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:12.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and check these
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:14.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}systems well enough to,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:15.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}quote,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:17.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"continue responsibly scaling
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:19.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at maximum speed for much longer."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:22.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So who holds the last rung?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And do you get a say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.39,0:08:26.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Right now, the labs hold
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.93,0:08:28.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that rung themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At Anthropic, every action
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:32.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}those 30,000 agents take
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:33.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}passes a monitor first:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:36.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a machine watching the machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}About 50 cases a week
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}reach a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:40.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But that's a lab checking itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:42.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So who checks the lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:45.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Outsiders, like those evaluators.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This fall, the leaders
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:47.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of the biggest AI
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}companies promised to let
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:50.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}outside auditors in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:51.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not required.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:53.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Making it binding
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.89,0:08:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is up to lawmakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the stop itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:08:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tao Lin was asked
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:00.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}whether his own lab
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.22,0:09:01.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will pause before AI
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:04.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}builds AI on its own:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.51,0:09:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}I do expect Anthropic
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:09.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to slow down or briefly pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:10.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He wants more: every lab slowing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:14.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to about a quarter
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:15.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of today's pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And cautious labs slowing alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he says, buy only a year or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the stop has to be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:23.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}agreed in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:26.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Here, even rivals sound alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}OpenAI's chief scientist wants
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:29.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the labs' safety
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:31.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}rules made mandatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:33.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Anthropic says the world should
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:34.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have the option to pause,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with rules set beforehand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and outsiders at the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That includes the people
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you vote for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:42.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your question for them
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:44.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}takes no expertise:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:45.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who checks the labs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.59,0:09:47.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and who can call a stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Ask it, and the last
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:49.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}rung isn't left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:50.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to the companies racing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}each other up the ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:54.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Machines now do the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.60,0:09:56.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People still do the deciding:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what gets built,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:10:00.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who checks it, and when to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So how close is AI
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to building its own successor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:06.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Two rungs: taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:08.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The third: shared,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and by the best-known forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:11.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}taken next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The last two: in human hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.59,0:10:16.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that forecast only holds
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.29,0:10:18.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if nobody chooses to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:20.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}When you turn off
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:21.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the light tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:23.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machines will go on building.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You may be using one of the last
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:28.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI models designed by human minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:29.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The next one may be able
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:31.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to design its own successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:33.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Whether it's allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:35.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to is still a human decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:36.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's the last rung.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:38.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it's still ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.73,0:10:40.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:44.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}arrives well for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.55,0:10:45.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:46.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Subscribe.
